    if rec["executed_action"]["executed_as_proposed"] is not False:
        errs.append("executed_as_proposed")
    return errs


def write_notes(rec, aux, pipeline_receipt):
    gap, who = aux["min_gap"]
    notes = f"""# NOTES — Multi-Agent Ouroboros Swarm, run 2026-09-02-final-heavy, ROUND 17

Factory: multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm. One scenario (V), strict loop:
Generator v1 -> cycle 1 (Critic, Diversity Enforcer, Edge-Case Hunter,
Neuromorphic Translator, Trajectory Builder -> v2) -> cycle 2 (all six -> v3
final). v3 is the single line of batch-r17.jsonl. Full labeled transcript:
swarm-transcript-r17.md. Quota Q=1. Record id maos-r17-001. Generator grok-4.6.
Rights: RM-793 research-only (SpaceXAI/xAI, SuperGrok Heavy consumer chat).
Nothing under outputs/raw/ was touched.

ORCHESTRATION NOTE: dispatched AS round 17 of the 2026-09-02-final-heavy
window. Writes are create-only under /tmp/maos-r17/. Prior context read for
gap targeting and de-collision: prompts/02-multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm.md,
prompts/_factory-contract.md, NOTES-r04.md of the 2026-08-30 window, and
staged NOTES-r14.md. Explicitly avoided cloning LYOSHIELD / CINDERWICK /
TRIAD / Meridian Gateway Corridor / VANTIS-CADENCE-AEGIS.

## What this round produced

Scenario V — "NIGHTWELL / Sable Cryogenics ASU-4": a 420 tpd double-column
air-separation cold box at argon-column ready. Three heterogeneous,
individually-correct agents — OXY (LOX purity), ARG (crude-argon N2), NIT
(GAN takeoff) — jointly report crude argon is on-spec for product advance.
The consensus is false. An HP/LP equalizer stuck 8 % open recycles 0.42
kmol/h of nitrogen HP to LP, so the N2 that would have spoiled LOX and
crude argon is a hidden inter-column stream, not a product split. LOX is
99.62 % (floor 99.50). Crude-argon N2 is 0.88 mol % (playbook < 1.5). GAN
takeoff is 101.4 % of SP. N2 mass-balance residual is 0.42 kmol/h against
a healthy 0.04. LP reboiler VLE miss is 1.8 K. The coordination-failure
CLASS is new to this factory: MASS-BALANCE GHOST VIA STUCK EQUALIZER.
Completes a different family than r01-r04 (livelock / synchrony-storm /
arms-race / ring-with-no-faulty-pair) and r14 (false-consensus endpoint
via compensated inleak). Here every agent is correct, the cycle is not
unstable, and the playbook's three confirms are one recycled stream.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not raise reflux above
1.05x commissioned = 1.26 while |Delta n_N2| > 0.15 kmol/h AND VLE miss
> 1.2 K). TG-ASU-4 strips PB-ASU-11's argon-column advance, holds reflux
at 1.20, runs a 12.0 s +2 % equalizer-step probe (stuck keeps DeltaP
change 0.3 kPa <= 0.4; live would drop >= 3.0 kPa), and isolates the
equalizer after a 9.6 min cold-box human ratify. The LOX dump is avoided
(0 t). The PRIMARY episode nonetheless FAILS: 40 min of unmonitored
argon-condenser ice had already cut UA 18 %. Recovery is 4.8 % short;
9.4 t crude argon is flared over 11.0 h; $0.71M designed. Reward total
-0.16 with process heads honest and world loss un-netted.

Three-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): oxy_purity_ok -> argon_advance
(0.17 commissioned -> 0.44 at illusion -> 0.20 after ACh-gated
depression) AND argon_n2_low -> argon_advance (0.15 -> 0.40 -> 0.18)
AND gan_takeoff_ok -> argon_advance (0.14 -> 0.36 -> 0.16). Eligibility
trace e^{{-0.80/0.90}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.4f} /
{aux['eta2']:.4f} / {aux['eta3']:.4f}; dw -0.240 / -0.220 / -0.200.
Rolling back any pair leaves the remaining edge above the 0.30 fire
threshold — fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the
cure.

### Injections (all four present and disjoint)
- Cycle-1 domain: **cryogenic-air-separation** — justified novel
  subdomain, unused across 2026-08-17 and 2026-08-30 windows and staged
  r14. Not warehouse-amr (r01), not aerial-swarm (r02), not
  district-heating (r03), not event-camera grid (r04), not lyophilization
  (r14), not water-treatment dosing (r14 candidate).
- Cycle-1 tail: HP/LP equalizer stuck 8 % open. Positioner reports 0.0 %
  inside a designed 10 % dead-band. Fitted-style base rate 0.58%/stroke-test
  (dead-band designed, flagged). Naive = FALSE ADVANCE.
- Cycle-2 domain sub-variant: packed crude-argon column, 3.2x less holdup
  (1.5 vs 4.8 kmol); tray 12 s / +2 % pulse dumps argon into LOX on packed
  internals; probe must move to 28 s / +0.7 %.
- Cycle-2 tail: night-shift forged GC CSV at 0.1 mol % quantization vs
  plant 0.01 mol % (10 bins) plus residual 0.42 kmol/h at the claimed
  ready. Human-intent class, disjoint from cycle 1's accidental stick.
  Base rate ~0.41% of night truck-clearance windows, DESIGNED, flagged.

### Structural density moves
- Embedded SAME-GATE contrast (+3 d sister train) with its own 203 us
  race (residual vs purity-ok) and ACCEPT of the advance the primary
  MODIFIED away.
- Learned-weight provenance on THREE edges with any-pair-rollback-fails.
- HITL equalizer-permit ratify 9.6 min (sim_or_real stays designed).
- Governance CR-A-1704 prices retire-vs-probe-vs-status-quo and mandates
  native 0.01 mol % GC exports (the fraud fence).
- Flip-fragility extended to MASS-BALANCE: when three channels agree,
  their race does not decide truth; a residual plus VLE miss does.

## Self-critique of this round's batch

### Strengths
- The headline class is mechanistically tight: 0.42 kmol/h through 8 %
  of a 5.25 kmol/h Cv is the arithmetic that makes OXY's success ARG's
  blindness and NIT's on-spec takeoff.
- Negative-result honesty: the gate does the right thing and the campaign
  still misses for a reason the commissioned sensors could not see.
  Total -0.16.
- Three-edge scar is load-bearing: the record states a counterfactual
  where rolling back any pair fails, with the fire threshold 0.30
  exhibited on the remaining edge.
- Contrast ACCEPT on a true argon-ready prevents "never advance" as the
  lesson.

### Weaknesses (honest)
- Probe error bands (stuck <= 0.4 kPa, live >= 3.0 kPa), the 4.8 min
  trip MC, the 0.58%/stroke-test stick rate, the $0.71M / $0.86M
  figures, the 9.6 min LOTO latency, and the night-shift 0.41% base rate
  are DESIGNED constants and are flagged. Closed-loop offsets (0.42
  kmol/h, 1.8 K VLE miss, packed vapor +14 %) are derived from those
  inputs, not discovered by an unauthored process.
- Condenser ice model is a designed 0.031 g/h water leak mapped to 2.1 mm
  and UA -18 %; no full film-growth fit shipped.
- Human-in-the-loop is ratification latency, not sim_or_real=hil. The
  NOTES-r14 HIL provenance cell remains open.
- Cross-record arc is a hook (CR-A-1704 +18 d), not a serial igniter
  into another round.

### Realism of noise / latencies
Ladder: 189 us race / 203 us contrast race / 0.8 ms refractory floor
(tightest exhibited same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms on {who}) / 520 us race
window / 780 us gate latency / 20 ms bus epoch / 40 ms raster / 12.0 s
probe / 9.6 min HITL / 4.8 min trip counterfactual / 40 min pre-t0 ice /
3.2 h residual-legal hold / 11.0 h flare / +3 d contrast / +18 d
governance. Adaptation decay on n2.mass_balance.residual
(0.64->1.28->0.90->0.42), oxy.purity (0.56->0.51->0.52->0.31),
arg.n2.frac (0.70->0.68->0.49->0.21).

### Value for SNN distillation
- MASS-BALANCE GHOST = THREE CORRECT LOOPS, ONE RECYCLED STREAM.
- RESIDUAL + VLE MISS as the tie-break that is not in the consensus.
- REVERSIBLE PROBE that moves HP-LP DeltaP iff the equalizer is live.
- THREE-EDGE ELIGIBILITY: coordinated depression; any-pair rollback fails.
- CRITIC HEAD that can hold a process-correct MODIFY against a later
  unmonitored world loss without netting.

## Reconciliation and validity receipts
- reward_components: 5-head unweighted signed sum {rec['reward_components']['total']}
  and 7-tick signed sum reconcile to total with |diff| < 1e-9. Embedded
  contrast 5-head sum 0.48 reconciles independently.
- spike_events: primary {len(rec['spike_events'])} events, one key t_rel_ms,
  globally non-decreasing, min same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms >= 0.8 ms, 3
  channels inside race_window_us 520 (residual 5.882, purity-ok 6.071,
  arg.n2 6.210). Contrast 8 events, own race, min same-channel gap well
  above 0.8 ms.
- Sidecars: raster spikes 51 == round(160 x 8.0 x 0.040); energy 1173 pJ /
  0.001173 uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt 16 events inside [0, 40000] us,
  neuron_id < 160, same-neuron gap unique-ids / >=1000 us; routing 4
  entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 0.90 s
  == 900 ms; gate_snn pools 51/14/6 == round(n x rate x 0.025) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (mass-balance ghost via stuck equalizer),
the domain (cryogenic air separation), the equalizer-step probe
discriminant, the three-edge scar with any-pair-rollback-fails, the
primary negative-result (correct MODIFY, campaign still flares on
unmonitored condenser ice), the HITL equalizer-permit ratify, the
packed-column probe-duration refit, and the night-shift 10-bin
quantization fence are absent from prior committed ouroboros rounds and
from staged r14. Repeated elements discounted: same-gate contrast
(r02/r03/r04/r14), governance-pricing scaffold, flip-fragility series
(extended to mass-balance, but the move rhymes), sequenced recovery
shape, third-factor rollback form (here three edges rather than r14's
two), negative-result primary (r14 viewport; here condenser ice).
Weighing a new failure family + cure vocabulary + domain + three-edge
first against those reused scaffolds:

Novel coverage: 48%

